su say be default ob name say ya
su name loop be refinery def
su name listen ob la su name transcript from filename "artifacts/hear/talk-loop-input.wav" be hear do ko be platform ya
su name draft from ve name listen ob la su name lines ob text "Reply in one short sentence." for name mind to name text mind-out be write do ko be platform ya
su name speak from ve name draft ob la su name voice ob name mind-out be say vyah stream do ko be platform ya
su name stop from ve name speak ob la su name voice be say vyah cancel do ko be platform ya
prah
